      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Lindenwold was established on April 23, 1929, from Clementon Township, along with several other municipalities on the same day.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lindenwold%2C_New_Jersey",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The first official meeting of Lindenwold's government took place on May 31, 1929, in the old Fire Hall on Linden Avenue.",
